H0805B.def:
Someone from the tribe of Asher living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 30:13; 
son of: Israel (H3478) and Zilpah (H2153); 
brother of: Gad (H1410); 
half-brother of: Reuben (H7205), Simeon (H8095), Levi (H3878), Judah (H3063), Dan (H1835H), Naphtali (H5321), Issachar (H3485), Zebulun (H2074), Dinah (H1783), Joseph (H3130) and Benjamin (H1144); 
father of: Imnah (H3232), Ishvah (H3438), Ishvi (H3440), Beriah (H1283) and Serah (H8294); also translated "pine" or "cypress wood" at Ézéchiel 27:6(?); Ashurite at 2 Samuel 2:9(?); 
Group of a.sher (אָשֵׁר "Asher" H0836)
§ Ashurites = "guided: blessed"
adj
a tribe inhabiting the plain of Esdraelon
Asshuri = "steps"

H0806.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:24; 
son of: Hezron (H2696H) and Abiah (H0029J); 
half-brother of: Ram (H7410), Jerahmeel (H3396), Caleb (H3612H) and Segub (H7687H); married to Helah (H2458) and Naarah (H5292B); 
father of: Ahuzzam (H0275), Hepher (H2660), Temeni (H8488), Haahashtari (H0326), Zereth (H6889), Izhar (H3328), Ethnan (H0869) and Koz (H6976) 
§ Ashur = "black"
son of Pharez

H0813G.def:
A man of the Gomerians living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 10:3; 
son of: Gomer (H1586); 
brother of: Riphath (H7384A) and Togarmah (H8425)
§ Ashchenaz or Ashkenaz = "a man as sprinkled: fire as scattered"
1) a descendant of Japheth
2) a northern people, perhaps of Bithynia

H0836.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 30:13; 
son of: Israel (H3478) and Zilpah (H2153); 
brother of: Gad (H1410); 
half-brother of: Reuben (H7205), Simeon (H8095), Levi (H3878), Judah (H3063), Dan (H1835H), Naphtali (H5321), Issachar (H3485), Zebulun (H2074), Dinah (H1783), Joseph (H3130) and Benjamin (H1144); 
father of: Imnah (H3232), Ishvah (H3438), Ishvi (H3440), Beriah (H1283) and Serah (H8294); also translated "pine" or "cypress wood" at Ézéchiel 27:6(?); Ashurite at 2 Samuel 2:9(?); 
§ Asher = "happy"
1) son of Jacob and Zilpah
2) the tribe descended from Asher
3) a city east of Shechem in Manasseh

H0840.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:16; 
son of: Jehallelel (H3094); 
brother of: Ziph (H2128J), Ziphah (H2129) and Tiria (H8493) 
§ Asareel = "God holds"
a descendant of Judah through Caleb

H0841.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 25:2; 
son of: Asaph (H0623H); 
brother of: Zaccur (H2139J), Joseph (H3130I) and Nethaniah (H5418H); also called Jesharelah at 1 Chroniques 25:14; 
Also named: ye.sar.e.lah (יְשַׂרְאֵ֫לָה "Jesharelah" H3480) 
§ Asarelah = "God holds"
a son of Asaph, appointed sanctuary musician by David

H0843.def:
Someone from the tribe of Asher who was living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 30:13; 
son of: Israel (H3478) and Zilpah (H2153); 
brother of: Gad (H1410); 
half-brother of: Reuben (H7205), Simeon (H8095), Levi (H3878), Judah (H3063), Dan (H1835H), Naphtali (H5321), Issachar (H3485), Zebulun (H2074), Dinah (H1783), Joseph (H3130) and Benjamin (H1144); 
father of: Imnah (H3232), Ishvah (H3438), Ishvi (H3440), Beriah (H1283) and Serah (H8294); also translated "pine" or "cypress wood" at Ézéchiel 27:6(?); Ashurite at 2 Samuel 2:9(?); 
Group of a.sher (אָשֵׁר "Asher" H0836) 
§ Asherites = "happy"
those descended from Asher

H0844H.def:
A man of the tribe of Manasseh living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:14; 
son of: Manasseh (H4519); 
brother of: Machir (H4353)
§ Ashriel or Asriel = "I shall be prince of God"
1) a great-grandson of Manasseh, and son of Gilead
2) a son of Manasseh

H0845.def:
Someone descended from Asriel who was a man of the tribe of Manasseh living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Nombres 26:31; 
son of: Gilead (H1568H); 
brother of: Abiezer (H0044I), Helek (H2507), Shechem (H7928), Shemida (H8061) and Hepher (H2660A)
Group of as.ri.el (אַשְׂרִיאֵל "Asriel" H0844) 
§ Asrielites = "I shall be prince of God"
the clan descended from Ashriel

H0850.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:11; 
son of: Mehir (H4243); 
father of: Beth-rapha (H1051), Paseah (H6454), Tehinnah (H8468) 
§ Eshton = "effeminate"
a descendant of Caleb of tribe of Judah

H0863H.def:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 23:29; 
son of: Ribai (H7380); also called Ithai at 1 Chroniques 11:31; 
§ Ittai or Ithai = "with me"
1) a Gittite commander from Gath in David's army
2) one of David's 30 mighty warriors, a Benjamite

H0867.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:21; 
son of: Zerah (H2226J); 
father of: Malchijah (H4441); also called Ethni at 1 Chroniques 6:41; 
Another name of ye.a.te.ray (יְאָֽתְרַי "Jeatherai" H2979) 
§ Ethni = "my hire"
an ancestor of Asaph

H0869.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:7; 
son of: Ashhur (H0806) and Helah (H2458); 
brother of: Haahashtari (H0326), Zereth (H6889), Izhar (H3328) and Koz (H6976); 
half-brother of: Ahuzzam (H0275), Hepher (H2660) and Temeni (H8488) 
§ Ethnan = "hire of unchastity"
a grandson of Ashur

H0878.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:37; 
son of: Zophah (H6690); 
brother of: Suah (H5477), Harnepher (H2774), Shual (H7777B), Beri (H1275), Imrah (H3236), Bezer (H1221H), Hod (H1936), Shamma (H8037H), Shilshah (H8030) and Ithran (H3506H) 
§ Beera = "a well"
a man of Asher
